<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Show Me The Way You Love</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">LEAP</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dark Habits</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6BqRPYigxVNlogN2uzOIXN</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Jack Scott"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Joey Arnold"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Tom Leach"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Jack Scott"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Joey Arnold"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Tom Leach"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I felt a hundred forces,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pulling me all towards you,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Still you walk away,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Softer than a language spoken,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Something in your heart was broken,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s written on your face,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Show me the way you love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s no life being lonely,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No love you can’t show me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No point feeling ugly,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If it’s cold, if it’s black,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can send it all back,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If it’s cold, if it’s black,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can send it all back,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I seen a hundred reasons,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How can you still be leaving?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The world can be so cold,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can't you see the fire blazing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Delicate the way we're fading,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't do this on your own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Show me the way you love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s no life being lonely,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No love you can’t show me,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No point feeling ugly,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Show me the way you love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No price for the feeling,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No crime to believe it,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hands up if you feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If it’s cold, if it’s black,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can send it all back,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If it’s cold, if it’s black,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can send it all back,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I get the feeling,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You don't wanna listen 'til the lights go,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Til the lights go down,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I get the feeling,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You got something missing, so,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Show me the way you love</p></div></body></tt>